From ae23d70df980c5e5afd4d642fb5fe9eeda3b14e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:24:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Prepare V2 signing commitments once per transaction

Cache identities, resolved CoinsRoot, OwnInputHash values and validated selectors before CHECKSIG/SIGHASH. The prepared path hashes only the fixed 138/150/178-byte preimage per invocation; retain the one-off wrapper for tests and wallet helpers. Verify prepared and wrapper digests match for all spend modes and mint mode in Debug and Release.
